Mint a live-view token and print the embed URL (the token is in the URL
fragment, which browsers never send to a server). Modes: dom (browser
agents), terminal (a new shell; needs --control) and desktop.

Usage:
  anona-compute view SANDBOX_ID [flags]

Flags:
      --control        allow input (control scope)
      --force          mint a desktop or dom view even if the sandbox's template has no desktop
  -h, --help           help for view
      --mode string    dom, terminal or desktop (default "dom")
      --ttl duration   token lifetime, 30s to 10m (default 10m0s)

Global Flags:
      --api-key string             API key (env ANONA_COMPUTE_API_KEY, E2B_API_KEY)
      --api-url string             API URL (env ANONA_COMPUTE_API_URL, E2B_API_URL; default https://api.<E2B_DOMAIN>)
      --json                       JSON output on stdout (same as -o json)
  -o, --output string              output format: text or json (default "text")
      --profile string             config profile to use (env ANONA_COMPUTE_PROFILE; default "default")
      --request-timeout duration   timeout for each API request (0 = none)
  -v, --verbose                    verbose output on stderr
